    "stdout": "T019 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (E : Set (GPEucl n)),\n  E.Nonempty →\n    ((∀ (k : ℕ) (x : GPEucl k) (t : ℝ), GPhead (GPappend x t) = x ∧ (GPappend x t).ofLp (Fin.last k) = t) ∧\n        (∀ (k : ℕ) (z : GPEucl (k + 1)), GPappend (GPhead z) (z.ofLp (Fin.last k)) = z) ∧\n          (∀ (k : ℕ) (x y : GPEucl k) (t u : ℝ), dist (GPappend x t) (GPappend y u) = √(dist x y ^ 2 + |t - u| ^ 2)) ∧\n            ∀ (k : ℕ) (z w : GPEucl (k + 1)),\n              dist (GPhead z) (GPhead w) ≤ dist z w ∧ |z.ofLp (Fin.last k) - w.ofLp (Fin.last k)| ≤ dist z w) →\n      (dimH GPI = 1 ∧\n          (∀ (s : ℝ), 0 < s → s < 1 → GPmass s GPI = ⊤) ∧\n            ∀ (k : ℕ) (A : Set (GPEucl k)) (e : ↑GPI → GPEucl k),\n              (∀ (t : ↑GPI), e t ∈ A) →\n                (∀ (t u : ↑GPI), dist (e t) (e u) = |↑t - ↑u|) →\n                  1 ≤ dimH A ∧ ∀ (s δ : ℝ), 0 < s → 0 < δ → GPcontent s δ GPI ≤ GPcontent s δ A) →\n        dimH E = 0 → dimH E + 1 ≤ dimH (GPproduct E)\n'Translation.T019' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
